    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's hard to see how things change though. it's not just a mood, it's my whole life. i see the look on her face every time she has to help me with something basic, like that exhausted sigh she does. it just feels like i'm stealing her life to support mine. i've become this parasite and i don't see how it ever gets better.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
