      "content": "Please hear me carefully: the thought that your absence would be better for your sister is a sign of immense pain, not truth. Those feelings of being a burden are symptoms of distress, not facts about your worth or your value to her. There are paths toward change, and professionals can help you see those paths even when logic feels impossible right now. If you are in crisis, please reach out immediately to a crisis hotline for immediate, compassionate support.",
